{"time": 1770646725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789166212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "班里顿时大半的视线都被吸引了过去，几道视线更是毫不掩藏探寻"}
{"time": 1770646798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890592147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（虚实）"}
{"time": 1770646918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101053695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "班长坐正了回去，就好像刚刚什么也没做"}
{"time": 1770706792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755126097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#去找将棋社团"}
{"time": 1770707994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059247278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "校园里人来人往，在这个时间点，氛围变得格外轻松，中午时感到的压抑消失不见。你走走停停，最后在图书馆对面的楼里看见了这个地方。"}
{"time": 1770708869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233885525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "将棋部，占用了约摸一个教室的大小，现在开着门，从门口看进去。里面的桌椅被挪开，取而代之的是数个榻榻米和其上摆着的棋盘，此刻里面正在热火朝天地对局，没什么人注意到门口的你"}
{"time": 1770709137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264657970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#站在门口观望一下，期待有人找自己搭话"}
{"time": 1770709438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696897822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "大概是观望的时间长了些，终于有人注意到了你，戴眼镜，打理得一丝不苟的男生走到你面前，“同学？你有什么事吗？”"}
{"time": 1770709518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11406539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“那个，请问你们的负责人是谁呢？”"}
{"time": 1770709792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128882212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我叫佐藤广，就是这里的负责人。”他介绍了一下自己，“同学是想加入将棋部吗？”"}
{"time": 1770709833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522407444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“欸是的，是的。请问手续流程怎么办呢”"}
{"time": 1770710215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323008565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯。”他走到讲台前，翻出了一张表格，“理论上这个时间应该没有社团申报的事情了，同学是突然想加入吗？”他把表拿在手里，一本正经地发问"}
{"time": 1770710313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950781624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“我是转校生，今天刚刚入学”"}
{"time": 1770710695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639724262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“转校生？”他倒也没有继续问下去，把手里的表格递给了你，包含了姓名班级，一些兴趣爱好之类的填写，但不知为何，在最后一栏，有一个是否相信迷信的问句。"}
{"time": 1770711173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1091825587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1770711203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341616863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#疑惑地看着他，用手指指这个问题"}
{"time": 1770711534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471912469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯。”他顺着你的手指看了下，“这个是本校社团联合会的传统，似乎十多年前就这样了。”他摆了摆手，“大家都是这么过来的。”"}
{"time": 1770711554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558730447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“好吧”"}
{"time": 1770711584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891540571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#填个否，然后把其他信息填上交给负责人"}
{"time": 1770711893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914871180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“矢吹绫...”你看见他愣住了，很是停了一会才开口，“三年三班？”"}
{"time": 1770711915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "355181321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1770711918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757403817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#歪头"}
{"time": 1770711947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299761200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“怎么了”"}
{"time": 1770712181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334551940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没什么，只是没想到会转到这里。”他看着你，带着些疑惑，但是没有表现出来，“应该没有什么问题，不过妨碍我问一句，为什么要来将棋部吗？”"}
{"time": 1770712377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362132908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”个人爱好吧。既没有什么运动天赋，也不太擅长什么手工活……“"}
{"time": 1770712379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99521566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”小时候，家里有一副将棋，无聊的时候就自己和自己下着玩，慢慢就养成习惯了“"}
{"time": 1770712681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318310351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”他扶了扶自己的眼镜，“我知道了，祝你在神弃川过得开心。对了。”他停了停，看向你，“三年三班发生了什么怪事吗？”"}
{"time": 1770712755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413981782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”欸，有什么怪事吗？我不太清楚。“"}
{"time": 1770712782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192167781", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”倒是有一些同学对此讳莫如深的……可能有吧“"}
{"time": 1770712801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407592884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”倒是有一些同学对此讳莫如深的……可能怪事确有其事吧“"}
{"time": 1770713025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922276353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哦，我知道了。”他稍微点了点头，看着你的表格，“但是矢吹同学不是不信么？”"}
{"time": 1770713143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341645565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”灵异本身也许并不存在，但是探求灵异的过程，也很有趣吧“"}
{"time": 1770713161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593273084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”总之，即使别人说起什么不可思议的事情，我也不会特意扫兴啦“"}
{"time": 1770713554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093487034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这样。”他的语气平淡，为这场谈话结了尾，“空出去的席位矢吹同学都可以坐，会有感兴趣的社员来找你下棋。”"}
{"time": 1770713585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913489206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”好的，谢谢”"}
