{"time": 1770730003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49748107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“Checkmate！”对面的女孩笑着看了看你，甚至你感觉对方留了手的样子，“我叫凌川慎，你叫什么？”"}
{"time": 1770730132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9394651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“我叫矢吹绫，你下的很不错呢”"}
{"time": 1770730217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624425406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（虽然将棋里面Checkmate叫一步诘（）"}
{"time": 1770730228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583262118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1770730366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165771212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没有啦，只是这一次发挥比较好。”她摸了摸自己的后脑勺，有些不好意思地笑了笑，“能看出矢吹同学也很厉害啦，之前也有在练习吧？”她放松地后仰着，头发顺着重力垂落"}
{"time": 1770730436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013529545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“略有研究啦”"}
{"time": 1770730465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476361734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#回味着刚才的对局"}
{"time": 1770730513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963773739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“对我来说，将棋比其他社团活动有趣多了”"}
{"time": 1770730915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234992875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？也有更有意思的吧？”她抬起身子，数着手指，“做菜啦，画画啦，不谈室外的话，还有桌面游戏吧？”"}
{"time": 1770731046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674326598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“除了策略类型，我不太擅长其他方面的活动呢。欸嘿嘿……”"}
{"time": 1770731102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999688444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“也许，以后也会有体会各种各样的东西。不过，只有将棋陪我最久。”"}
{"time": 1770731366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779908111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唔唔，这样的话，想玩什么之后找我就好啦，我是二年三班的，不过...之前好像没见过你？”她的手指点在自己的下巴上，带着些疑惑"}
{"time": 1770731446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228436872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“我是转校生，今天才开始参加这个社团”"}
{"time": 1770731632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297499972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？绫酱是转校生吗？”她猛得凑近了一点，眼睛里满是好奇，像是盛着星光，“唔唔，从哪里转来的？”"}
{"time": 1770731767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406978333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“京都那边过来的”"}
{"time": 1770731780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276597575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“不过，我是神弃川本地人哦”"}
{"time": 1770731803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329112795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（刚翻了下卡，其实我是名古屋过来的（）"}
