{"time": 1770732669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17385861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?我也好想去京都看看啦，奈良的鹿，京都的宫殿，感觉很舒服很舒服啦。\"她有些泄气，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1770732697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1989820223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“怎、怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1770732900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280973906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好难离开哦，毕竟明年很难熬嘛。\"她吐出口气，你感觉她整体软绵绵地"}
{"time": 1770732942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623219014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“呃，这个确实呢，呵呵……”"}
{"time": 1770732952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944267931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#决定不告诉她自己的年级"}
{"time": 1770732999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304500196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是吧?尤其还是在三班。\"她鼓了鼓脸颊，\"真受不了，什么时候可以离开啦。\""}
{"time": 1770733039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005044528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“三班有什么特别的吗？”"}
{"time": 1770733381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405881148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔?\"她歪了歪脑袋，\"绫酱不是本地人吗？嗯?\""}
