{"time": 1770733568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456897006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=405881148]“哎呀，太久没回来，有点忘了”"}
