{"time": 1770805830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127929035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”她应该就是母亲所说的‘避灾’之人吧，也怪可怜的“"}
