{"time": 1770807317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638626707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(镇子南边是码头，北边是矿山，有穿山隧道，西边是墓地，学校在正中央，旁边就是老街。选一下你家在什么方位吧。)"}
{"time": 1770807351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210968941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（选家没绷住）"}
