{"time": 1771901245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412200323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“是新来的转校生，赶紧上学吧，不然等下班主任要生气了”班长的语速倒是很快"}
{"time": 1771901264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914413345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1036106955", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那个女生若有所思地点点头，盯了你一会。"}
